      "spam": false,
      "value": "Visime shape keys?  You use shape keys for various voice sounds\naa, ch, ee, ff, kk, ih, nn, oh, ou, pp, ss, th\n\nWhat are shape keys? They are defined position for vertices to shift to, and are on a blended slider bar, they are not linked to bones, but are their own thing.  vertices will move between these based on the sound coming from one's voice.\n\nThis sounds like what you are requesting.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
