      "spam": false,
      "value": "Jelly said one-frame animations, I'm pretty sure they meant use of the unity animator or unity animations instead of the client-controlled visemes.\n\nA unity animation as lip sync allows for more options, like effects or toggles. Robot eyes flashing in time with speech, for example.",
